```
+## Where did the apache2 recipes go?
+
+Recipes are now modules, so your cookbook pattern will go from
+
+```ruby
+include_recipe 'apache2'
+include_recipe 'apache2::mod_proxy'
+include_recipe 'apache2::mod_proxy_http'
